      "notes": "Jubilees 4:14 names his wife Mualeleth. Book of Jasher 2:11-12 says Kenan ruled wisely, inscribed prophecies of the Flood on stone tablets, and fathered 3 sons (Mahalalel, Enan, Mered) and 2 daughters (Adah, Zillah).",
      "major": true
    },
