      "notes": "Jubilees 4:28 names his wife Betenos; Book of Jasher 4:11 names her Ashmua, daughter of Elisha son of Enoch! 1 Enoch 106 & Qumran 1Q20 recount his awe at Noah's luminous birth.",
      "major": false
    },
    {
